00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.868 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Today's Friday and that's
usually when I catch up

00:00:01.868 --> 00:00:02.569 line:92%
with some personal stuff.

00:00:02.569 --> 00:00:04.070 align:start size:94% position:6%
I check my inbox,
return some emails,

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:05.939 align:start size:94% position:6%
