♪♪♪♪

00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:24.190 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Wow.

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:25.859 align:start size:94% position:6%
Olympic spirit.
-Yeah.

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:28.661 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
